sequenceDiagram
    participant Main
    participant PL as Playlist
    participant VC as VolumeControl
    participant DC as DeterministicClock
    participant PC as PlaybackController
    participant PS as PlayerSnapshot
    Main->>PL: construct and add MediaItem(s)
    Main->>VC: construct
    Main->>DC: construct
    Main->>PC: new PlaybackController(PL, VC, DC)
    Main->>PC: play()
    Main->>DC: advance(1000)
    Main->>PC: onClockAdvanced()
    PC->>PS: getSnapshot()
    PS-->>Main: immutable snapshot
    Main-->>Main: print minimal demo info and exit